______________________________________PRINT WITHOUT A NEW LINE______________________________________
   By default, the print() function ends with a new line. If you want to print multiple words on the same line, you can use the end parameter, for example: print("Hello World!", end=" "); print("I will print on the same line."). Note that we add a space after end=" " for better readability.

